<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC barley estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC issued the following monthly barley estimates (million tonnes). (Revisions for 1995/96 marked with *)    96/97 (Aug/Sept)  95/96 (Aug/Sept)</p>
<p> Opening stocks			   0.629	    *0.401</p>
<p> Harvested crop			   9.357	     7.739</p>
<p> Use on farms			     2.787	    *2.462</p>
<p> Other domestic use		     1.603	    *1.504</p>
<p>  - incl. animal feed		   0.950	    *0.862</p>
<p> Exports to EU			    1.930	    *2.244</p>
<p> Exports to non-EU			1.800	    *0.221</p>
<p> Final stock				0.736	    *0.629</p>
</text>
